# Contact form delivery — free, no backend required.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com, enter aachalr579@gmail.com, get an access key instantly.
# 2. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below.
# Without this set, the form still validates but falls back to opening the visitor's
# email client (mailto:) instead of silently pretending to succeed.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
